  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "This bright restaurant has a large dining area. Two children enter through the entrance with an adult. A tidy table and a chair are ready for them. At the counter, a friendly cashier helps a customer while others wait nearby. The menu board shows pictures of food. Another customer uses a card to pay beside the cash register. A customer also uses the self-service kiosk. The restaurant is busy, and people work in the kitchen. An employee brings food to the counter. Through the glass, the children see other children play in the playground. A combo meal includes a burger, fries, and a drink. The à la carte menu lets customers choose each item. Dine-in customers enjoy their food in the dining area. Another customer carries takeout in a paper bag toward the exit. The exit is on the other side of the room.",
    "textZh": "這間明亮的餐廳有一個寬大的用餐區。兩位小朋友和一位大人從入口進入。一張整潔的桌子和一張椅子正等著他們。在櫃檯旁，一位親切的收銀員協助顧客，其他人在附近等候。菜單看板上有餐點圖片。另一位顧客在收銀機旁使用卡片付款。也有一位顧客使用自助點餐機。餐廳裡很忙碌，廚房裡有人正在工作。一位店員把餐點送到櫃檯。小朋友透過玻璃，看見其他孩子在遊戲區玩耍。套餐包含漢堡、薯條和飲料。單點菜單讓顧客選擇每一樣餐點。內用的顧客在用餐區享用餐點。另一位顧客拿著裝在紙袋裡的外帶餐點走向出口。出口在室內的另一側。",
